00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,379
Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy says China urged Russia not to use nuclear weapons in Ukraine, according to Politico Europe.

2
00:00:10,329 --> 00:00:16,711
He said European leaders told him about Beijing's message at the NATO summit in Ankara.

3
00:00:16,711 --> 00:00:24,652
If confirmed, the report would show China trying to limit escalation while still keeping influence with Moscow.

